Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Study (never merged): world-flat-light-ladder, world
 packets flat-textured with a per-packet CLUT from a palette light ladder

RANKED C1 prototype for the Quake lane. Off by default; with the feature the world
writer emits FT3/FT4 raw-texture packets and picks the CLUT word from
WORLD_LIGHT_LADDER by the packet's mean corner green, and the oversize repair
reads the flat layout.
